{
  "reasoning": "The defendant organized and mobilized villagers via mass text messages to gather at a construction site and physically block the work by climbing a tower crane, causing the project to be halted for an extended period and resulting in significant economic loss and social impact. This conduct constitutes a coordinated disturbance of public order at a public place (the construction site), fitting the statutory offense of organizing a crowd to disrupt public place order and traffic order.",
  "final_answer": "聚众扰乱公共场所秩序、交通秩序"
}
